6-A. Jurisdiction. - (1) The lurisdiction of the Wapda University, lslamabad' shallextend lo the whole oJ Pakistan with its principal seat tocated at lslamabad'(2\ The University may have sub-campuses within Pakistan or abroad with the priorapproval of the Patron, relevanl Provincial Governments and Higher Educc tionCommission (HEC), Pakistan.
Chapter lll
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
7. Principal Officers,- The tollowing shall be the principal officers of the Univesity'
namely:-
a) The Patron;b) The Chancellor:c) The Pro Chancellor;d) The Rector;e) The Pro Rector;f) The Deans;g) The Principals of the constiluent colleges/units;h) The Chahpersons of the teaching departmentsii) The Registrar;j) The Treasurer;k) The Controller of Examinations;l) The Resident Auditor; andm) Such other persons as may be prescribed by the Statutes or Regulaticns tobe the principal officers of the University;8. Patron.- (1) The President of lslamic Republic of Pakistan shall be the Patron of theUniversity.(2t The Patron shall, when present, preside at the convocation of theUniversity. ln the absence ofthe Patron, the Chancellor shall preside overthe convocation of the University.
(3) Every proposal to confer an honorary degree shal! be subject toconfirmation by the Patron.9. Visitation,- (1)The Patron may, in accordance with the terms and proc€duresas may be prescribed, cause an inspection or inquiry to be made on hisrler own rnotionor at the request of the Commission in respect of any matter connecled with the affairsPage 6 of :14

